    "text": "BACKGROUND ACTION\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 2, CC 81 to 95\n   1 Setting\n   2 Interior or exterior\n   3 Motion of the environment\n   4 Temperature\n   5 Weather\n   6 Scale of the place\n   7 Repetition in frame\n   8 Crowds and repeats\n   9 suite: The weather feels it too\n  10 suite: Sea of people\n  11 pair: When it rains, surfaces are soaked\n  12 pair: When sadness rises, the rain starts\n  13 pair: When tension rises, the background goes still\n  14 pair: When the leader moves, the crowd follows in a ripple\n  15 pairs: The world mirrors the feeling"
   },
